  "title": "Reynolds Consumer Products Declares Regular Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "LAKE FOREST, Ill. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 23, 2026-- Reynolds Consumer Products Inc. (Nasdaq: REYN) announced that its Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.23 per common share. The dividend is payable on August 31, 2026, to shareholders of record as of August 17, 2026.",
